# The CV PDF is ASCII85-encoded end to end, so it contains no NUL bytes and git
# autodetects it as text. With core.autocrlf=true that rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout, shifting every byte offset in the PDF xref table and breaking the
# file. Mark binary assets explicitly.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
